{"title":"《梦与光之随笔》B站工房小店发售！","uid":"0a643b3627b8ee4f29ce2918775fb808","slug":"《梦与光之随笔》B站工房小店发售！","date":"2026-11-03T08:06:53.000Z","updated":"2026-11-03T08:26:13.618Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/《梦与光之随笔》B站工房小店发售！.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/image/t4_2.png","content":"<p>收录40+东方同人画作<br>历经两次设备升级，一次风格转变<br>画龄两余年画师的心灵笔录<br>一场从零开始的梦幻漂流</p>\n<p>时隔多日，SFSunshine个人画集《梦与光之随笔》终于在<strong>B站工房小店</strong>上和大家见面了！<br>包含四十余精心挑选的画作和稿件<br>涵盖开始创作至今的全部时期<br>采取四色印刷，画质、色调高还原<br>你还可以看到许多稿件的无水印高清版本</p>\n<p>此外，11月7日，我们会在<strong>CPT-F</strong>（COMICUP漫展）的<strong>幻想药谷摊位</strong>（<strong>壹G12</strong>）继续进行线下贩售！</p>\n<p>如果你曾听说过，或者看过SFS的作品<br>亦或者是对宣传感兴趣，那么请来支持画集！</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n    <img src=\"/image/t6_1.png\" alt=\"B站工房\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 60%;\">\n</div>\n\n \n<p>B站小店链接：<br><a href=\"https://mall.bilibili.com/neul-next/index.html?page=mall-up_itemDetail&noTitleBar=1&itemsId=1109166108&from=items_share&msource=items_share\">https://mall.bilibili.com/neul-next/index.html?page=mall-up_itemDetail&amp;noTitleBar&#x3D;1&amp;itemsId&#x3D;1109166108&amp;from&#x3D;items_share&amp;msource&#x3D;items_share</a><br>宣传视频（求转）：<br><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FVap61EmL\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FVap61EmL</a></p>\n","feature":true,"text":"收录40+东方同人画作历经两次设备升级，一次风格转变画龄两余年画师的心灵笔录一场从零开始的梦幻漂流 时隔多日，SFSunshine个人画集《梦与光之随笔》终于在...","permalink":"/post/《梦与光之随笔》B站工房小店发售！","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":492,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"Artwork","slug":"Artwork","count":3,"path":"api/categories/Artwork.json"},{"name":"Product","slug":"Artwork/Product","count":2,"path":"api/categories/Artwork/Product.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Artwork","slug":"Artwork","count":3,"path":"api/tags/Artwork.json"},{"name":"2026","slug":"2026","count":5,"path":"api/tags/2026.json"},{"name":"Book","slug":"Book","count":2,"path":"api/tags/Book.json"},{"name":"advertisement","slug":"advertisement","count